        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cat Got Your Tongue</i></strong> is a quirky little platformer inspired by the classic phrase “Cat got your tongue?” — a saying used when someone’s too shy or hesitant to speak. But in this game, you’re not the nervous human — you’re the mischief-making cat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a naughty little black cat jumping and scrambling across a human’s tongue, determined to snatch his tiny voice and stop him from expressing his inner thoughts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go get your claws and join our evil kitty crew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 Controls:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Arrow Keys or A &amp; D to control jump direction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Spacebar to attack enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✨ Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun &amp; Whimsical Interactions</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vertical jumping game packed with surprises: dodging oral bacteria, avoiding tartar-blasting toothpaste, riding guinea pigs, slipping on buttered toast, or catching sight of mysterious waving kitties — all await your discovery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute and Grotesque Art Style</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of adorable and weird visuals, with hand-drawn comic scenes between stages and alternate endings depending on your success or failure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and Snackable Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round lasts just a few minutes — perfect for quick, casual play sessions.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode for Hardcore Cats</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Endless level awaits players who crave a real challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 The game can be tricky — don’t lose your temper (or your keyboard)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Note: The game launches in fullscreen by default, which might affect resolution. Please adjust screen settings manually in “Setting.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Credits:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shanshan – Design, Art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finn – Design, Blueprint, Music</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cat Got Your Tongue</i></strong> is a quirky little platformer inspired by the classic phrase “Cat got your tongue?” — a saying used when someone’s too shy or hesitant to speak. But in this game, you’re not the nervous human — you’re the mischief-making cat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a naughty little black cat jumping and scrambling across a human’s tongue, determined to snatch his tiny voice and stop him from expressing his inner thoughts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go get your claws and join our evil kitty crew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 Controls:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Arrow Keys or A &amp; D to control jump direction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press Spacebar to attack enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✨ Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun &amp; Whimsical Interactions</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vertical jumping game packed with surprises: dodging oral bacteria, avoiding tartar-blasting toothpaste, riding guinea pigs, slipping on buttered toast, or catching sight of mysterious waving kitties — all await your discovery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute and Grotesque Art Style</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of adorable and weird visuals, with hand-drawn comic scenes between stages and alternate endings depending on your success or failure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and Snackable Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round lasts just a few minutes — perfect for quick, casual play sessions.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode for Hardcore Cats</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Endless level awaits players who crave a real challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 The game can be tricky — don’t lose your temper (or your keyboard)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Note: The game launches in fullscreen by default, which might affect resolution. Please adjust screen settings manually in “Setting.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Credits:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shanshan – Design, Art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finn – Design, Blueprint, Music</p>",
        "short_description": "Cat Got Your Tongue is a vertical platformer where you play a mischievous black cat, jumping and attacking across a tongue to stop the protagonist from speaking, with quirky art, playful interactions, and fast-paced, challenging yet casual gameplay.",
